{
 "file": "06BLK07K base 0x5000",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:3e",
   "ptr": "0x3e",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "「わっはっは、照れるじゃないか」\\f",
   "en": "\"Wahaha, you're making me blush!\"",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:69",
   "ptr": "0x69",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「このヒト、辺境では一番の力持ちだっ\\n",
   "en": "\"They say this guy was the strongest man in all the Frontier.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:92",
   "ptr": "0x92",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "  たんですって」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:69"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:ad",
   "ptr": "0xad",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "「あたしも変身してみたーい！」\\f",
   "en": "\"I wanna transform too!\"",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:d6",
   "ptr": "0xd6",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "「ぼくらは自警団の者です」\\f",
   "en": "\"We're with the militia.\"",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:fb",
   "ptr": "0xfb",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「貴族がいるうちは、奴らの雇った兵士\\n",
   "en": "\"While the nobles were around, I hated the soldiers they hired... But now that they're gone, without soldiers the town just keeps getting rougher.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:124",
   "ptr": "0x124",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "  が大嫌いだったけど・・・  こうして、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:fb"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:14f",
   "ptr": "0x14f",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  いなくなってみると、やっぱり兵士が\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:fb"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:178",
   "ptr": "0x178",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "  いないと街が荒れる一方だ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:fb"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:19a",
   "ptr": "0x19a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　しかたないから、おれたち若いモンが\\n",
   "en": "So we young fellas had no choice but to start a militia. Dunno how far we'll get, though.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:1c3",
   "ptr": "0x1c3",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "  自警団を作ってみたのさ。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:19a"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:1e2",
   "ptr": "0x1e2",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  どこまでやれるか分かんないけどね」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  自警団を作ってみたのさ。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:19a"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:211",
   "ptr": "0x211",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「ぼくは、ついこの間まで、城で下働き\\n",
   "en": "\"Until just recently, I worked as a servant at the castle. I've only just started practicing with the sword. If a swordsman like you were on our side...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:23a",
   "ptr": "0x23a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  をしてました。剣の練習も始めたばっ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:211"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:263",
   "ptr": "0x263",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  かりです。あなたのような剣士が味方\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:211"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:28c",
   "ptr": "0x28c",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "  になってくれたら・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:211"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:2aa",
   "ptr": "0x2aa",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　・・・あ、いや、異国の方にこんなこ\\n",
   "en": "...Ah, no, it's rude to say such a thing to someone from abroad. I'm sorry.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:2d3",
   "ptr": "0x2d3",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "  と言うのは失礼ですよね。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:2aa"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:2f2",
   "ptr": "0x2f2",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "  すみません」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  と言うのは失礼ですよね。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:2aa"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:313",
   "ptr": "0x313",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「市民を守ってくれる王がいて、その王\\n",
   "en": "\"A king who protects the citizens, and an army that protects that king. If that were how things stood, we citizens would gladly work for the king.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:33c",
   "ptr": "0x33c",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  を守る軍隊がある。そんな関係であっ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:313"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:365",
   "ptr": "0x365",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  たなら、おれたち市民は喜んで王のた\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:313"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:38e",
   "ptr": "0x38e",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "  めに働くだろう。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:313"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:3a6",
   "ptr": "0x3a6",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　不幸なのは、自分とその一族のことし\\n",
   "en": "The unlucky ones are citizens ruled by a king who thinks only of himself and his kin. That's just what we were until recently.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:3cf",
   "ptr": "0x3cf",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  か考えない王に統治された市民だ。こ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:3a6"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:3f8",
   "ptr": "0x3f8",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "  の間までのおれたちが、まさにそれさ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:3a6"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:424",
   "ptr": "0x424",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　まあ、奴らはもともと遠くから来て、\\n",
   "en": "Well, that bunch came from far away, slaughtered the people of this land, conquered it all, and built their country on top of it.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:44d",
   "ptr": "0x44d",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  この地の人々を虐殺し、侵略しつくし\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:424"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:476",
   "ptr": "0x476",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  た上に国を建てた連中だから、奴らに\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:424"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:49f",
   "ptr": "0x49f",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  何か期待しようってのが間違いだった\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:424"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:4c9",
   "ptr": "0x4c9",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "  んだろうけどね」\\f",
   "en": "Guess it was a mistake to expect anything from 'em.\"",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:4e3",
   "ptr": "0x4e3",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「王が市民に愛される国だったら、兵士\\n",
   "en": "\"In a country where the citizens love their king, even the soldiers would earn the citizens' trust. That's the kind of army I want us to be.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:50c",
   "ptr": "0x50c",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  だって市民に信頼を受けるだろう。そ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:4e3"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:535",
   "ptr": "0x535",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "  んな軍隊を目指したいね」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:4e3"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:562",
   "ptr": "0x562",
   "len": 6,
   "jp": "市長\\n",
   "en": "Mayor",
   "max": 6,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:56b",
   "ptr": "0x56b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「今のところ、自警団の働きもあって、\\n",
   "en": "\"For now, thanks partly to the militia, we're somehow keeping the peace...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "市長\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:594",
   "ptr": "0x594",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  なんとか治安が保たれてますが・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:56b"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:5be",
   "ptr": "0x5be",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　正直、こんな状態が続いては、先行き\\n",
   "en": "But frankly, if things go on like this, I can only say the outlook is bleak.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:5e7",
   "ptr": "0x5e7",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "  は暗いとしか言えません。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:5be"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:607",
   "ptr": "0x607",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　各地から避難して来た人たちに加え、\\n",
   "en": "On top of the people who fled here from all over, the surviving frontier folk have gathered in this city too, and we are now caught up in chaos beyond control.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:630",
   "ptr": "0x630",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  生き残った辺境の人たちもこの街に集\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:607"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:659",
   "ptr": "0x659",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  まり、我々は、今や収拾のつかない混\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:607"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:682",
   "ptr": "0x682",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "  沌に巻き込まれています。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:607"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:6a2",
   "ptr": "0x6a2",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　その上、人々は《黒竜》による死の恐\\n",
   "en": "What's more, the people live in terror of death by the Black Dragon. Panic could break out any day now...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:6cb",
   "ptr": "0x6cb",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  怖に脅え、明日にでも恐慌が起こりか\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:6a2"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:6f4",
   "ptr": "0x6f4",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "  ねない有り様・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:6a2"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:70e",
   "ptr": "0x70e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　そうなったら最後、私ごときの力では\\n",
   "en": "Once that happens, it's over. Someone like me can do nothing about it. We will destroy ourselves without even waiting for the Black Dragon to awaken.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:737",
   "ptr": "0x737",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  どうにもなりません。我々は《黒竜》\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:70e"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:760",
   "ptr": "0x760",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  の目覚めを待たずして、自らを滅ぼし\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:70e"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:789",
   "ptr": "0x789",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "  てしまうでしょう。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:70e"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:7a3",
   "ptr": "0x7a3",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　未だ、姿を見せぬ《黒竜》・・・\\n",
   "en": "The Black Dragon has yet to show itself... And yet, because of a Black Dragon whose form we have never even seen, we are facing our ruin.",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:7c8",
   "ptr": "0x7c8",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　しかし我々は、その姿さえも見ぬ《黒\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:7a3"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:7f1",
   "ptr": "0x7f1",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  竜》のせいで、滅びの時を迎えようと\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:7a3"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:81a",
   "ptr": "0x81a",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "  しています。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:7a3"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:82e",
   "ptr": "0x82e",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　《黒竜》に食われた者などいない。\\n",
   "en": "No one has been eaten by the Black Dragon. No one has been trampled by the Black Dragon. No one knows what it looks like. So why?!",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:855",
   "ptr": "0x855",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  《黒竜》に踏み殺された者もいない。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07K:82e"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07K:87e",
   "ptr": "0x87e",
   "len": 26,
